---
title: Gridded Data — Icechunk Repositories
---
flowchart LR
    AORC["NOAA AORC<br/>Observed meteorology<br/>for each storm"]
    HMS["HEC-HMS Runs<br/>Excess precipitation<br/>for each event"]
    RAS["HEC-RAS Runs<br/>Depth &amp; velocity<br/>for each event"]

    AORC -->|accumulate| OBS["🧊 observed_precip repo<br/>Dimensions: lon × lat × time<br/>Variables: precip, temperature, ...<br/>Indexed by: storm_id<br/>Snapshots grow with each storm<br/><br/>Catalog: obs_grids"]
    HMS -->|merge across runs| HMSREPO["🧊 hms_excess_precip repo<br/>Dimensions: lon × lat × time<br/>Variables: excess_precip<br/>Indexed by: event_id<br/>Snapshots grow with each event<br/><br/>Catalog: output_grids"]
    RAS -->|merge across runs| RASREPO["🧊 ras_output repo<br/>Dimensions: lon × lat<br/>Variables: max_depth, max_velocity<br/>Indexed by: event_id<br/>Snapshots grow with each event<br/><br/>Catalog: output_grids"]

